# Explicit exclusions for the published tarball.
#
# `files` in package.json is the authoritative allowlist, so this file exists
# mainly to stop npm falling back to the repository .gitignore. That fallback is
# fragile: a future root-level ignore pattern could silently drop generated/ from
# the published package, and the failure would only show up as a broken import
# for whoever installed it.

# The generator, not needed by consumers — generated/ is what ships.
build.mjs

# Local artefacts from `npm pack`.
*.tgz
packlist.txt
